        <mxCell id="run-s3" value="Judge Scores Each Turn&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;3-tier: auto-fails → LLM rubric → cross-turn&lt;br/&gt;same model judges its own output&lt;/font&gt;"
